<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Petmin div static on raised year shr.</title>
<headline>Petmin div static on raised year shr.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Feb 28</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     73.0	  vs  61.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 10.0	  vs  10.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   11.69	 vs   7.95</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   11.70	 vs   7.95</p>
<p>    Tax			  3.64	 vs   2.45</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    0.97	 vs   0.63</p>
<p>    Turnover		  84.97	 vs  61.23</p>
<p>Full name: Petra Mining Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Gold miners and contractors Petmin said it had made several acquisitions since the year end to complement its existing activities and further diversify the risk associated with full-scale gold mining operations.</p>
<p>The total purchase price of the investments was 69.69 million rand, which would be settled through the issue of 17.42 million new Petmin shares at four rand each.</p>
<p>One of its major acquisitions was 51 percent of JIC Mining and Construction Ltd with effect from March 1, for 36.72 million rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
